s a vital role in enhancing patient care and outcomes in the healthcare sector.", "NESTLÉ:Nestlé is a global multinational food and beverage company renowned for its extensive range of nutritional products and solutions. The company provides resources for managing dysphagia through its health management website and is recognized for its specialized nutritional offerings, including enteral formulas and products tailored for children and patients with specific dietary needs. Among its notable products are Novasource, Resource Diabet, Resource Peptide, Resource Diabet Plus, and various nutritional drinks such as Renutryl and Resource 2.0.\n\nNestlé also produces a variety of nutritional supplements, including Isosource Protein, Isosource Mix, Resource Support Plus, and Impact Enteral, catering to diverse dietary requirements. The company is committed to supporting health management through dietary software like Dietsource® and has a strong focus on infant nutrition and milk fortifiers. Additionally, Nestlé has been involved in the development of the Mini Nutritional Assessment (MNA), first published in 1994 and revised in 2006, further emphasizing its dedication to nutritional health. Overall, Nestlé stands out as a leader in the food and beverage industry, particularly in the realm of nutritional products.", "VEGENAT:VEGENAT is a company dedicated to the nutrition and feeding of elderly individuals, actively sponsoring the series \"Envejecimiento y Nutrición.\" In 2014, VEGENAT produced documents focused on ideal diets for the elderly and nutritional interventions for fragile elderly individuals. The brand is associated with health and nutrition, as indicated by its logo and collaborative efforts. VEGENAT specializes in plant-based nutritional products, offering dietary supplements tailored to specific health needs, including solutions for dysphagia. The company manufactures a variety of dietary products, such as TDiET HP, TDiET HP sin fibra, T-Diet PLUS for diabetic patients, Diaba HP, TDiET 2, T-DIET Energy, Atémpero Enteral, Dienat G, and Suppresi. Overall, VEGENAT is committed to providing high-calorie and plant-based nutritional solutions, collaborating with healthcare institutions to enhance the well-being of its consumers.", "NUTRICIA:Nutricia is a specialized nutrition company that is part of the Danone Group, focusing on medical nutrition and dietary products. The brand is known for producing a wide range of nutritional products, including arginine supplements, enteral formulas, and specialized nutritional formulas for infants and children. Nutricia's product offerings include Nutrison Protein Plus, Nutrison Protein Plus Energy, Nutrison Multifibre, and Nutrison Advanced Cubison, among others. \n\nThe company develops products aimed at providing nutritional support for various medical needs, including energy supplementation for patients requiring additional caloric intake, as exemplified by their Infatrini® formula. Nutricia also addresses specific dietary requirements for individuals with metabolic disorders, such as phenylketonuria, and offers resources for patients with dysphagia. \n\nIn addition to their focus on pediatric nutrition, Nutricia provides dietary management solutions for adults, including products like Fortimel Complete, Fortimel Extra, and Forticare. Their commitment to specialized nutrition is evident in their extensive range of medical nutrition products designed to meet the unique needs of patients across different health conditions. Overall, Nutricia is dedicated to advancing medical nutrition and providing tailored dietary solutions for individuals with specific nutritional requirements.", "SEMI:SEMI is an organization that provides information and resources for patients dealing with dysphagia.", "MOODLE:Moodle is a widely used online learning platform designed for educational purposes, facilitating various forms of online training and courses. It is particularly effective for structured training programs, including those in biomedical education.", "FUTURE LEARN:Future Learn is an online learning platform that provides a diverse range of courses and educational resources, making it a popular choice in the field of online education. The platform offers various training programs, including those specifically focused on health education, catering to a wide audience seeking to enhance their knowledge and skills through accessible online learning opportunities.", "DR. GOOGLE:Dr. Google is a colloquial term referring to the practice of searching for medical information online, often leading to misinformation.", "TRH LAB:TRH Lab is a telemedicine platform that provides resources and information for patients and professionals regarding dysphagia.", "DYSFAGIAWEB:DysfagiaWeb is an online platform that offers information and resources for patients dealing with dysphagia.", "DYSFAPP:Dysfapp is an application designed to assist patients and professionals in managing dysphagia.", "OSAKIDETZA:Osakidetza is the health service of the Basque Country that provides resources for patients with dysphagia.", "DISFAGIA NUTRICION:Disfagia Nutricion is an organization that offers nutritional resources for patients with dysphagia.", "DISFAGIA SOLUCION:Disfagia Solucion is an organization that provides solutions and resources for managing dysphagia.", "SOCIEDAD ESPAÑOLA DE ENDOCRINOLOGÍA Y NUTRICIÓN:The \"Sociedad Española de Endocrinología y Nutrición\" (SEEN) is a prominent professional organization based in Spain, dedicated to the study, research, and treatment of endocrine and nutritional disorders. It plays a crucial role in the dissemination of knowledge in these fields, having published various guidelines, manuals, and educational resources, including the \"Manual de Endocrinología y Nutrición.\" \n\nSEEN is involved in the research and education of endocrinology and nutrition, providing valuable resources for the evaluation and management of various conditions, such as dislipemias, metabolic bone disease associated with home parenteral nutrition, hyperprolactinemia, and multiple endocrine neoplasia. The organization also offers online video courses and other educational materials to support training in these areas.\n\nAs a scientific society, SEEN is committed to promoting the advancement of endocrinology and nutrition in Spain, and it supports the professional development of its members, including notable figures such as Nuria Valdes Gallego, who has been actively involved in the Neuroendocrinology and Thyroid Area and served on the board from 2008 to 2011. Overall, the Sociedad Española de Endocrinología y Nutrición is a vital institution for healthcare professionals in Spain, fostering research, education, and best practices in the fields of endocrinology and nutrition.", "DYSHPHAGIA THERAPY:Dysphagia Therapy is a mobile application designed to assist medical professionals in evaluating swallowing disorders and determining appropriate rehabilitation options."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}